{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105497","id":2466422926,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TAqCO","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105497","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105497.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105497.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105497","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105497/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105497/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105497/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cbaa178a79ef3bd5c8ce9e2ba04c10067b84e107","number":105497,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve the message overlay in the 3D editor","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This makes the overall experience closer to Blender.\r\n\r\n- ~~Use a fixed-width font[^1], fixed decimal count and tab characters to ensure displaying rapidly changing numbers doesn't cause reflowing.~~\r\n  - No longer needed now that the editor defaults to a font with fixed-width digits enabled.\r\n- Add padding for negative numbers to further reduce reflows when a number goes from a negative to a positive value and vice versa.\r\n  - Figure spaces are used to have a space character that has the same width as a minus sign (for fonts with fixed-width digits).\r\n- Improve coordinate display to be more readable.\r\n- Use the `m` suffix for \"meter\" like in the inspector, and `°` for degrees.\r\n- Use a font outline to make the text more readable on bright backgrounds.\r\n- Use sentence case and don't end messages with a period.\r\n\r\nThese changes can be ported to the 2D editor once we reach an agreement on them.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15012 (by providing a similar solution that improves readability on mixed-color backgrounds).\r\n\r\n[^1]: If we used a default editor font with fixed-width numbers, we could keep using a proportional font for letters. Many other places in the editor would benefit from this, including the View Information/View Frame Time panels and the inspector. This exists as an OpenType stylistic alternate in some fonts like [Inter](https://rsms.me/inter/), but Noto Sans does not have this alternate.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n<img width=\"501\" height=\"89\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/45052b31-93cc-4f20-b355-f34410f85825\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"429\" height=\"92\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9702229-f1fe-4013-8fba-0fd3540f8317\" />\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Old version</summary>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/096332cc-aed6-4015-be91-adaca5081490\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8088f4c3-f41a-4a69-812f-95ef52be180d)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b2b9c35a-00a9-49e0-8928-031383996bc2)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dafd8fd1-9c72-4a3d-86fe-269ca1392c8f)\r\n</summary>","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us